      "message": "It looks like the commit message doesn\u0027t quite match the diff.\n\nNothing here restores the slice on swap-in: `do_swap_page()` and `unuse_pte()` have kept it since aosp/4312507, and aosp/4379310 restores the siblings. The PTE walk is `MADV_PAGEOUT`/`MADV_COLD` batching rather than reclaim, and the smaps and `MADV_FREE` changes aren\u0027t mentioned.\n\nSince these are independent changes (madvise batching, smaps swap PSS, swapoff exclusivity), would you consider splitting them, each with its own motivation? The `MADV_FREE` hunks might fit well with aosp/4367971 to aosp/4367973.",
