      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T00:59:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think `DIV_ROUND_UP(mapcount, P3S_SLICES_PER_PAGE)` is only right when every sharer maps all four slices.\n\nIf a parent and a forked child each map one slice of a swapped folio, the swap count is 2, this makes it 1, and both would report the 4KB as private swap PSS.\n\nCould this count the window\u0027s swap PTEs that hold `swpent`, the way `vma_slice_ptes()` counts present slice PTEs, and divide by that? The helper would fit nicely in `include/linux/p3s/proc.h`.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "bea188b10f140ee2fffcc94314caf5a6d016f673",
