      "message": "Would you mind moving this loop into `mm/p3s/rmap.h` as a helper built on `p3s_pte_maps_folio()`, with a one-line dispatch here?\n\nAlso, `folio_size(folio) / mm_pte_size(mm)`, here and at line 526, is what `vma_folio_nr_ptes()` computes.",
